My most embarrasing death involves a lawful human Valkyrie who was
preparing to kill Rodney.  She had a full kit, stack of +6 daggers,
maxed armor, maxed weapons, spare cursed !oGL, the whole works.  Now,
as is my habit, I was altar camping for a while, hoping to convince
just a little bit more protection from my god, and had therefore
summoned some monsters to sacrifice.  The summoned monsters just
happened to be giants, which were too heavy to lift to the altar.  So
she fell to eating them... without checking that she was already
satiated.  To anyone lucky enough to get that girl's bones files via
Hearse, that was me.  "almkglor, choked on a hill giant corpse".

What was nasty was she was wearing a GoP, which meant that any
strength boost would be moot.  And yeah, she had a spare "oLS in open
inventory and 2 spares in the BoH, as well as a "oMB in the stash near
the altar.


